# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mod certification pins.
#
# The recipe declares exactly two mods, in this order:
#     mods/instanttensor-hybrid-draft-loader
#     mods/dsv4-reasoning-effort-fix
#
# Only these two, in this order, may ever be applied. Any other directory under
# mods/ is rejected outright.
#
# THE AUDITED MOD BYTES ARE NOT AVAILABLE.
# The read-only audit evidence recorded that the mods were applied, but not
# their contents, so no trustworthy digest exists for either of them. Both pins
# below are therefore the literal token UNAVAILABLE, and that is not a
# placeholder to fill in casually — it is a statement of fact about the
# evidence.
#
# CONSEQUENCE: an EXACT launch is impossible today and fails closed.
# scripts/40-start.sh refuses to apply mods in exact mode while any required
# digest is UNAVAILABLE. To make an exact launch possible you must
#   1. obtain the audited mod directories from the vendor,
#   2. pin their contents with scripts/25-pin-mods.sh --apply, and
#   3. replace the corresponding UNAVAILABLE below with the printed digest.
# Do not invent a digest from a mod you merely believe is correct; that
# converts "unknown" into a false claim of exactness.
#
# A NON-EXACT launch is still possible via scripts/40-start.sh --non-exact-mods,
# which requires a strong typed confirmation and stamps a permanent marker
# inside both containers so verification can never mistake it for exact.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Required mods, space separated, in recipe order. Not configurable: this list
# is the recipe. Adding to it does not make another mod part of this recipe.
PIN_MODS_ORDER="instanttensor-hybrid-draft-loader dsv4-reasoning-effort-fix"

# Content digest of each mod, as printed by scripts/25-pin-mods.sh.
# The digest is the SHA-256 of the mod's canonical MOD.sha256 manifest, which
# in turn lists the SHA-256 of every file in the mod directory.
PIN_MOD_DIGEST_INSTANTTENSOR_HYBRID_DRAFT_LOADER="UNAVAILABLE"
PIN_MOD_DIGEST_DSV4_REASONING_EFFORT_FIX="UNAVAILABLE"

# Per-mod manifest filename inside each mod directory.
PIN_MOD_MANIFEST="MOD.sha256"

# Certification markers written inside each container by scripts/40-start.sh.
# Non-secret, human-readable, and read back by scripts/60-verify-deployment.sh.
PIN_MOD_MARKER_EXACT="/workspace/MODS_EXACT"
PIN_MOD_MARKER_NON_EXACT="/workspace/MODS_NON_EXACT"
